From: game-project
Subject: [PATCH] Add GP_BLINK (9000) — Blink 15 custom skill

Blink 15: teleport-forward skill for the "Blink 15" admin-panel skill
validation. Reuses skill_blown()/unit_blown()/path_blownpos() exactly like
TF_BACKSLIDING (skills/thief/backslide.cpp), just feeds the OPPOSITE facing
direction so skill_blown's internal vector negation lands the character
forward instead of backward. Stop-before-blockage and out-of-map behavior
come for free from path_blownpos's CELL_CHKPASS walk (map/path.cpp) — same
collision the rest of the game uses, no parallel logic.

Range (Knockback), cooldown (Cooldown) and SP cost (Requires.SpCost) live
entirely in skill_db.yml, written by the admin panel
(apps/api/src/store/yaml-skill-repository.ts) — none of that is hardcoded
here.

See docs/claude-context (skills area) and CLAUDE.md for project context.
